    <div class="profile-copy">
      <h2 class="profile-heading"><span class="raster">About me</span></h2>
      <p class="profile-body">
        I am a Product Designer drawn to problems that are equal parts human and technical, the kind that make you rethink what software can <em>feel</em> like. Growing up in Toronto, I was surrounded by immense diversity. It shaped how I listen to context, to nuance, to the things people shouldn't need to say out loud. It's the same instinct I lean on when designing for real users today.
      </p>
      <p class="profile-body">
        I just graduated with a Master's in Human-Computer Interaction + Design from the University of Washington, and am excited for the next chapter!
      </p>
      <div class="fact-list">
        <div class="fact-card">
          <p class="fact-file">exploring.txt</p>
          <p class="fact-text">learning 3D modeling, printing, and <span class="fact-wave">motion design!</span></p>
        </div>
        <div class="fact-card">
          <p class="fact-file">after-hours.txt</p>
          <p class="fact-text">weightlifting and eating my way through the city.</p>
